          <groundspeak:finder id="321730">Sleepy_hollow</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP740 - Mann Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We had a few things to do this morning around the capital city and decided to take a short drive to check out a few caps and had the good fortune of finding this one. The snow was deep at this spot, but you couldn't miss the survey tape that marked the cap site. Thanks OFTH for setting this one up.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="661695794">
          <groundspeak:log_wpt lat="54.161033" lon="-11.492983" />
          <groundspeak:date>2017-01-14T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="985002">Strider&#39;s Ride</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP740 - Mann Lake&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The pink flagging near the cap could be seen from a distance and finding the cap was just a matter of making our way up the slope and moving some snow around. We were well practiced at that today, so it turned out to be a quick one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;TFTCap ofth!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
